1
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:24,650
Form the Demon-Subduing Array!

2
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,840
Today, we will conquer the Demon Capital

3
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:36,900
and wipe out every demon!

4
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:00,140
I will never allow it!

5
00:01:19,670 --> 00:01:20,920
I sensed earlier that this demon

6
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,170
had unusually dangerous demonic power.

7
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,930
It's the ancient ferocious beast, the Netherblood Fiend!

8
00:02:07,830 --> 00:02:09,350
All its internal organs are shattered.

9
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,300
It won't survive much longer.

10
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:11,850
Master, you've been poisoned by the demon.

11
00:02:11,990 --> 00:02:13,330
We must return to the sect for treatment.

12
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,290
You mustn't push yourself.

13
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:17,500
Return to the sect.

14
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:18,780
Yes, Master.

15
00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:44,900
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

16
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:52,900
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

17
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:58,180
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

18
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:09,420
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

19
00:03:09,780 --> 00:03:16,540
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

20
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:24,420
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

21
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:32,460
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

22
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:40,580
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

23
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:47,140
[Blossom in Darkness]

24
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:49,140
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

25
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:52,140
[Episode 18]

26
00:03:58,710 --> 00:03:59,410
Youyou...

27
00:04:20,870 --> 00:04:21,460
Youyou.

28
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,540
Stay back!

29
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,660
Come any closer, and I'll kill you!

30
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,660
Youyou.

31
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:07,100
I hid my true form on purpose

32
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,610
because

33
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,450
if you'd known

34
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:13,610
I was a Netherblood Fiend

35
00:05:14,310 --> 00:05:15,370
when I first

36
00:05:15,370 --> 00:05:16,850
snuck into Yunyi Sect,

37
00:05:18,070 --> 00:05:19,780
you would've thrown me out.

38
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,610
Quick! Put her on the bed!

39
00:06:00,070 --> 00:06:00,660
Easy.

40
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:11,930
Drink up.

41
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:12,780
I lost a lot of blood

42
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,850
saving you this time.

43
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:15,050
You'd better not waste a single drop,

44
00:06:15,070 --> 00:06:15,730
or you'll regret it!

45
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,050
Master Shen.

46
00:06:35,190 --> 00:06:36,050
Could you fetch me some water?

47
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,170
I'll tend to her wounds.

48
00:06:37,270 --> 00:06:37,610
All right.

49
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,560
You know I don't have a talisman

50
00:06:55,030 --> 00:06:57,440
and I'm an ancient Netherblood Fiend.

51
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,100
Why did you still save me?

52
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:01,850
We're friends.

53
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:03,250
No need to make a big deal out of it.

54
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,700
Besides, no matter how fierce you are,

55
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,700
can you really be worse than Qi Fengyin?

56
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:08,930
Friends?

57
00:07:09,390 --> 00:07:09,930
All right.

58
00:07:10,270 --> 00:07:10,900
Enough talking.

59
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:12,810
Your internal organs are all shattered.

60
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,250
You need plenty of rest to recover.

61
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,700
We'll deal with the talisman later.

62
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:18,100
Just focus on getting better.

63
00:07:22,740 --> 00:07:25,740
[Wind Moon Lounge]

64
00:07:39,870 --> 00:07:40,900
Youyou sent you here?

65
00:07:41,510 --> 00:07:42,410
How is she now?

66
00:07:50,270 --> 00:07:50,930
Youyou's fine.

67
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,980
She secretly kept a fragment

68
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,410
and sent me to find you and Yamao.

69
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,900
Right now, we need

70
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,610
to find the Demon Soul Talisman in this era.

71
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:58,580
We can't let it fall into

72
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,410
the hands of Luoliang Immortal Sect.

73
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:00,730
But Youyou doesn't have

74
00:08:01,270 --> 00:08:02,410
the Demon Soul Talisman yet.

75
00:08:03,310 --> 00:08:04,140
How is that possible?

76
00:08:04,830 --> 00:08:05,900
Without the Demon Soul Talisman,

77
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,170
does that mean

78
00:08:07,430 --> 00:08:08,340
we can't return to our own time?

79
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,140
Her condition is stable now?

80
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:20,170
The Moonlit Revival Herb can bring her back from the brink.

81
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:21,370
But...

82
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:24,850
That girl named Yamao...

83
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,780
You two must be close, right?

84
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,370
The mystical flower on her head

85
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,700
probably grew from your dark energy.

86
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,850
What are you getting at?

87
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,530
If you really care about her,

88
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,340
you must stop feeding that flower.

89
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,820
It's connected to her life force.

90
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:41,980
As it grows, she grows weaker.

91
00:08:43,510 --> 00:08:44,820
The day that flower fully blooms

92
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,530
is the day she dies.

93
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:57,340
That flower likely came from someone's soul.

94
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,230
It needs an enormous amount of power

95
00:08:59,230 --> 00:08:59,890
to bring that soul back to life.

96
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,250
It's attached itself to Miss Yamao

97
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,340
and shares her life force.

98
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:06,100
Once the flower fully blooms

99
00:09:06,510 --> 00:09:07,610
and the soul is restored,

100
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:09,250
she'll die.

101
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:12,610
How do you know all this?

102
00:09:13,750 --> 00:09:15,420
Yunyi Sect specializes in mystical herbs and plants.

103
00:09:15,790 --> 00:09:16,610
We also have some ancient texts

104
00:09:16,630 --> 00:09:17,820
that mention these techniques.

105
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,530
Then...

106
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,650
Is there any way to save them both?

107
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:28,460
I can tell you two are close.

108
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,820
You should warn Miss Yamao

109
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:33,060
to stop nurturing that flower.

110
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:01,530
How is Youyou doing?

111
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,220
She's badly hurt.

112
00:10:04,030 --> 00:10:05,490
I can heal her wounds,

113
00:10:05,750 --> 00:10:07,060
but the Leader of Wuwang Sect's array

114
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:07,730
was far too powerful.

115
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,490
The demonic core inside her

116
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:10,730
has been damaged by the array.

117
00:10:11,510 --> 00:10:12,180
She may

118
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,490
have to sleep for many, many years

119
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:16,530
before she might wake up.

120
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,370
She might wake up?

121
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:20,490
So that means...

122
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,130
she might never wake up?

123
00:10:26,750 --> 00:10:28,100
Our sect specializes in growing mystical herbs.

124
00:10:28,510 --> 00:10:29,610
Let me check our old texts when I get back.

125
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,060
I might find a way to save her.

126
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:34,340
I know a way.

127
00:10:35,390 --> 00:10:36,180
If...

128
00:10:36,550 --> 00:10:38,250
we give her an immortal's core,

129
00:10:38,790 --> 00:10:39,730
it could heal

130
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:41,420
the injuries she suffered from the array.

131
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,300
An immortal's core?

132
00:10:47,390 --> 00:10:48,060
Are you sure

133
00:10:48,550 --> 00:10:49,770
that would wake her up?

134
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,180
Without your immortal core,

135
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,650
all the cultivation you've done

136
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,890
will be for nothing.

137
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:27,880
And you'll never

138
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:28,860
be able to cultivate again.

139
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,850
Is it really worth it?

140
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,010
To you,

141
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,100
we've only known each other a few days.

142
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,040
But I've actually known her

143
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:37,890
far longer than you have.

144
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:41,180
Besides,

145
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:43,130
when it comes to love,

146
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,650
who can really explain it?

147
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,460
Wait!

148
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:20,580
I'm willing to do it.

149
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:22,220
Can't my immortal core

150
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,100
save her, too?

151
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,220
No, that's not it.

152
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:29,940
Master Shen, you've misunderstood.

153
00:12:30,790 --> 00:12:31,850
I lied to you.

154
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:32,980
Youyou is fine.

155
00:12:33,510 --> 00:12:34,770
With medicine and a few days of rest,

156
00:12:34,910 --> 00:12:36,060
she'll recover quickly.

157
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,060
Her demonic powers are strong.

158
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,180
She'll be back on her feet soon.

159
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,100
Don't worry.

160
00:12:39,630 --> 00:12:40,490
Why did you lie to me?

161
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,490
I wanted to use this chance

162
00:12:44,550 --> 00:12:45,850
to test your character

163
00:12:46,150 --> 00:12:47,520
and see if you were someone

164
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:48,700
Youyou could truly trust with her heart.

165
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:50,940
I was being petty

166
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:51,730
and suspicious.

167
00:12:52,030 --> 00:12:52,970
I put you through

168
00:12:52,970 --> 00:12:53,940
all that suffering for nothing.

169
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:54,580
I'm sorry.

170
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,420
Youyou...

171
00:12:58,630 --> 00:12:59,940
She'll wake up after a little rest.

172
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,100
Stay with her, Master Shen.

173
00:13:01,390 --> 00:13:02,700
I'll go prepare some more medicine

174
00:13:02,750 --> 00:13:03,650
to restore her strength.

175
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:22,770
You're lucky to have

176
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:24,340
such a good friend.

177
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:25,610
If Miss Yamao hadn't

178
00:13:25,610 --> 00:13:26,890
deliberately attacked Yunyi Sect,

179
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,820
who knows how long we'd have gone

180
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:29,980
without ever truly knowing each other?

181
00:13:41,870 --> 00:13:42,650
That scared me half to death.

182
00:13:43,150 --> 00:13:44,180
How could he just decide

183
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,010
to give up his immortal core?

184
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,130
I barely managed to stop him.

185
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:55,770
Qi Fengyin.

186
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:01,300
What's with that look?

187
00:14:05,630 --> 00:14:06,370
Yamao.

188
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:07,650
Qingxing?

189
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,060
You...

190
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,220
Don't touch him.

191
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:17,250
Sorry. I'm just surprised

192
00:14:17,630 --> 00:14:18,490
High Immortal Danshen

193
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,010
was actually brought back to life.

194
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:22,980
If I set my mind to something,

195
00:14:23,390 --> 00:14:24,250
I always see it through.

196
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,580
You said Youyou sent you back.

197
00:14:30,870 --> 00:14:32,220
How is she doing now?

198
00:14:32,870 --> 00:14:34,100
Has she been punished?

199
00:14:34,750 --> 00:14:36,220
Youyou's locked up in Wuchang Prison.

200
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:37,980
But luckily, the sect leader is guarding her.

201
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:39,650
No one will hurt her.

202
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:42,340
Youyou asked me to bring back the Demon Soul Talisman.

203
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,940
Without her demonic core,

204
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:45,180
she can't cultivate her powers.

205
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:50,820
Earlier, Qi...

206
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:56,300
So Sir Qi was telling the truth.

207
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,130
Youyou really

208
00:14:58,390 --> 00:14:59,580
doesn't have the Demon Soul Talisman now.

209
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,610
When I treated her injuries,

210
00:15:01,630 --> 00:15:02,460
I checked for it myself.

211
00:15:03,910 --> 00:15:06,940
Could her spirit really have weakened,

212
00:15:07,910 --> 00:15:09,180
causing her to forget her past

213
00:15:09,750 --> 00:15:11,100
and get things mixed up?

214
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,770
Even if Youyou can't remember her past,

215
00:15:13,030 --> 00:15:13,940
she handles the talisman

216
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,100
with such ease.

217
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:16,300
There must be

218
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,820
a deep connection between them.

219
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,580
The immortal sects attacked the Demon Capital

220
00:15:20,670 --> 00:15:22,530
because villages within a hundred miles

221
00:15:22,670 --> 00:15:24,300
were slaughtered overnight.

222
00:15:24,670 --> 00:15:26,610
But the city gates were shut on New Year's Eve.

223
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,300
I suspect another powerful demon was behind it.

224
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:29,530
Suspicion isn't proof.

225
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:30,730
We need evidence

226
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:32,060
to clear Youyou's name.

227
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:35,220
You're going to investigate?

228
00:15:35,750 --> 00:15:36,770
I'll come with you.

229
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:37,610
No.

230
00:15:37,790 --> 00:15:38,940
Stay here. I'll go alone.

231
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,940
If you run into danger during the day,

232
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:41,820
you won't be able to defend yourself.

233
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:43,580
Enough. Stop arguing, you two.

234
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:45,530
I'll look after High Immortal Danshen.

235
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:47,100
Nothing will happen to him.

236
00:15:48,150 --> 00:15:48,700
All right.

237
00:15:48,870 --> 00:15:50,490
Shen Wangyan is in the Demon Capital now.

238
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,420
And with you,

239
00:15:51,420 --> 00:15:52,650
a true disciple of Mount Zhaowu,

240
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:53,850
if anyone from Wuwang Sect

241
00:15:53,850 --> 00:15:54,470
attacks the city again,

242
00:15:54,470 --> 00:15:55,300
you two can hold them off.

243
00:15:57,630 --> 00:15:58,300
Yamao.

244
00:15:59,030 --> 00:16:00,700
That Immortal Shen...

245
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:03,010
What's his relationship with Youyou?

246
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,250
Him?

247
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:06,340
He and Youyou are getting married soon.

248
00:16:23,670 --> 00:16:24,300
Let's go.

249
00:16:26,030 --> 00:16:27,340
I can ride the wind with my powers.

250
00:16:27,670 --> 00:16:28,460
You're still pushing yourself?

251
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:29,970
The Wanjun Lock nearly pierced

252
00:16:29,970 --> 00:16:31,360
right through your arm.

253
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,530
Who knows

254
00:16:32,550 --> 00:16:34,060
how long your powers will hold up?

255
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:34,610
I don't want

256
00:16:34,630 --> 00:16:35,650
to fall out of the sky halfway there.

257
00:16:41,030 --> 00:16:42,220
Come on. Give me your hand.

258
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,610
I could tell you didn't know how to ride.

259
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:54,610
Hold on to me.

260
00:17:33,030 --> 00:17:34,330
More medicine?

261
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:35,660
That's right.

262
00:17:37,030 --> 00:17:38,050
You've been stuck inside recovering

263
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:39,290
these past few days.

264
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:40,910
Aren't you curious

265
00:17:40,910 --> 00:17:42,050
about what's been happening in the city?

266
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,420
I lifted the seal on the city gates.

267
00:17:48,110 --> 00:17:49,140
The people I brought

268
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,330
to the Demon Capital

269
00:17:50,830 --> 00:17:52,380
have seen my true form.

270
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:55,050
I bet most of them have fled by now.

271
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,050
I'm sick of being

272
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:01,810
the Demon Queen anyway.

273
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:02,900
Good riddance.

274
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:04,090
At least it'll be peaceful.

275
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,490
I don't care one bit.

276
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:10,380
How about this?

277
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:12,460
Let's get you outside for some fresh air.

278
00:18:31,420 --> 00:18:35,180
[Moonwatch Tower]

279
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,380
I thought once they found out

280
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:42,860
I was a Netherblood Fiend,

281
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:44,900
they'd all run for their lives.

282
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,620
The day Wuwang Sect attacked the Demon Capital,

283
00:18:48,110 --> 00:18:49,530
if you hadn't risked your life to protect them,

284
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,700
they would've all been slaughtered.

285
00:18:52,070 --> 00:18:53,250
You don't need to keep the gates sealed

286
00:18:53,310 --> 00:18:54,140
and hold them prisoner anymore.

287
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:56,570
And you don't need to scour the land

288
00:18:56,750 --> 00:18:57,290
for magical artifacts and treasures

289
00:18:57,510 --> 00:18:58,180
to give them.

290
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:01,730
Now,

291
00:19:02,510 --> 00:19:03,270
you're the Demon Queen

292
00:19:03,270 --> 00:19:04,530
they willingly follow and believe in.

293
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,380
Shen Wangyan.

294
00:19:32,830 --> 00:19:33,700
It's the first snow.

295
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:41,180
Whenever fresh snow falls in Luoliang,

296
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:43,490
the Wish Tree appears.

297
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:45,620
Couples hang dolls blessed with immortal bonds

298
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:46,570
from its branches

299
00:19:47,550 --> 00:19:49,180
to pledge their love for a lifetime.

300
00:19:57,070 --> 00:19:57,770
Youyou.

301
00:19:59,270 --> 00:19:59,810
Will you

302
00:19:59,830 --> 00:20:01,180
marry me

303
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:02,900
beneath the Wish Tree?

304
00:20:06,550 --> 00:20:07,380
No matter what happens,

305
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,250
I'll never let you down.

306
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:56,530
Qi Fengyin.

307
00:20:56,790 --> 00:20:57,330
Look.

308
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:58,660
This is snow.

309
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:31,420
Whenever fresh snow falls in Luoliang City,

310
00:21:31,830 --> 00:21:33,180
the Wish Tree appears.

311
00:21:35,110 --> 00:21:36,420
Let's uncover the truth

312
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:38,220
and get rid of the demon

313
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:39,050
that's really killing these people.

314
00:21:39,550 --> 00:21:40,570
Then I'll take you to the Wish Tree

315
00:21:40,590 --> 00:21:41,290
so you can see it for yourself.

316
00:21:49,310 --> 00:21:50,140
I think...

317
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:52,980
I've seen the Wish Tree before.

318
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:03,420
Right.

319
00:22:04,030 --> 00:22:04,730
I almost forgot.

320
00:22:06,030 --> 00:22:06,770
You've already been there

321
00:22:06,790 --> 00:22:07,810
with someone else.

322
00:22:10,110 --> 00:22:11,420
Youyou and Shen Wangyan

323
00:22:11,550 --> 00:22:12,570
are getting married soon, too.

324
00:22:13,070 --> 00:22:14,330
We need to get back soon.

325
00:22:14,790 --> 00:22:15,490
We can't let them

326
00:22:15,510 --> 00:22:16,330
miss their wedding day.

327
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,570
Wuwang Sect has been here.

328
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:37,860
They must've already searched the place

329
00:22:38,590 --> 00:22:40,010
and cleared away all the evidence.

330
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:42,250
Then we'll have to look

331
00:22:42,310 --> 00:22:43,330
for clues on the bodies.

332
00:22:49,350 --> 00:22:50,490
We're only doing this to find the killer

333
00:22:50,510 --> 00:22:51,620
and avenge your deaths.

334
00:22:52,070 --> 00:22:53,810
Forgive us for disturbing your remains.

335
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:55,090
Once we're done,

336
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:56,980
we'll give you all a proper burial.

337
00:23:02,110 --> 00:23:03,700
The demonic aura lingering here

338
00:23:04,510 --> 00:23:06,010
is a lot like Youyou's.

339
00:23:06,750 --> 00:23:07,700
But even so,

340
00:23:08,070 --> 00:23:09,460
I refuse to believe Youyou did this.

341
00:23:12,270 --> 00:23:12,980
Qi Fengyin.

342
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:14,570
Do you smell that?

343
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,700
There's a floral scent on these bodies.

344
00:23:18,590 --> 00:23:20,570
It's very strange,

345
00:23:21,350 --> 00:23:22,380
almost sinister.

346
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:35,770
This pollen

347
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:37,730
is tainted with my malice.

348
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:41,940
But aren't we

349
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:43,220
900 years in the past?

350
00:23:43,480 --> 00:23:45,570
How could your malice have spread here?

351
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:47,330
I don't know yet.

352
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:48,610
But earlier,

353
00:23:48,610 --> 00:23:49,860
I sensed a trace of malice.

354
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:52,460
That's actually good.

355
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,730
It'll help us track down the source.

356
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:07,010
There's a small cottage.

357
00:24:15,310 --> 00:24:16,460
Who would've thought this wisp of malice

358
00:24:16,480 --> 00:24:17,770
was hiding inside Yunyi Sect?

359
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,460
Youyou told me about

360
00:24:20,270 --> 00:24:21,220
this cottage...

361
00:24:21,750 --> 00:24:22,660
She said Shen Wangyan

362
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:24,140
spends some time in there every day.

363
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:26,140
Then Shen Wangyan must be involved.

364
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:58,490
Heart-Devouring Flowers.

365
00:24:59,270 --> 00:25:00,550
I've only read about them

366
00:25:00,550 --> 00:25:01,300
in my master's books.

367
00:25:01,410 --> 00:25:03,140
They're grown using demonic aura.

368
00:25:03,510 --> 00:25:04,090
Why would Yunyi Sect

369
00:25:04,350 --> 00:25:05,980
grow such sinister flowers?

370
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:11,380
Are you all right?

371
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:13,700
Qi Fengyin!

372
00:25:15,110 --> 00:25:15,810
Qi Fengyin!

373
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:21,980
Qi Fengyin!

374
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:23,010
Qi Fengyin!

375
00:25:25,270 --> 00:25:26,330
Keep your mind steady.

376
00:25:27,590 --> 00:25:29,380
These flowers corrupt people's minds.

377
00:25:30,030 --> 00:25:30,820
If we let them keep growing,

378
00:25:30,820 --> 00:25:32,050
you'll lose control completely.

379
00:25:33,030 --> 00:25:33,660
Qi Fengyin!

380
00:25:38,750 --> 00:25:39,420
Yamao.

381
00:25:41,070 --> 00:25:42,250
I can't hold out much longer.

382
00:25:42,750 --> 00:25:43,900
If something happens to me,

383
00:25:44,960 --> 00:25:46,220
push me outside the magical barrier.

384
00:25:46,680 --> 00:25:47,220
No.

385
00:25:49,270 --> 00:25:49,980
Not while I'm here.

386
00:25:51,070 --> 00:25:52,490
I won't let anything happen to you.

387
00:26:09,030 --> 00:26:09,900
Yamao.

388
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:12,330
I just saw

389
00:26:12,680 --> 00:26:13,900
the immortal sects in ruins,

390
00:26:15,160 --> 00:26:17,140
with blood flowing like rivers.

391
00:26:17,720 --> 00:26:18,620
None of that was real.

392
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:21,700
The flowers made you see those visions.

393
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:23,290
Really?

394
00:26:34,110 --> 00:26:35,860
Shen Wangyan tends this garden.

395
00:26:36,880 --> 00:26:37,900
How could he not know

396
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:39,460
there are Heart-Devouring Flowers here?

397
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:42,660
Youyou should've recovered by now.

398
00:26:43,510 --> 00:26:44,770
I wonder how she's doing.

399
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:57,220
I'm almost completely healed.

400
00:26:57,590 --> 00:26:58,940
Do I really have to drink this?

401
00:26:59,240 --> 00:27:00,700
You need to finish your medicine.

402
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:02,700
Otherwise, you might never fully recover.

403
00:27:25,830 --> 00:27:27,010
Are you all right, Youyou?

404
00:27:32,590 --> 00:27:34,050
I just spaced out for a moment.

405
00:27:35,270 --> 00:27:37,010
Maybe the medicine's too bitter.

406
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:42,330
I only revealed my true form once.

407
00:27:42,830 --> 00:27:43,510
Why can't I

408
00:27:43,510 --> 00:27:44,940
control my demonic nature even now?

409
00:27:45,520 --> 00:27:45,960
Here.

410
00:27:50,050 --> 00:27:50,530
Oh, right.

411
00:27:50,820 --> 00:27:52,490
I went back to the sect today

412
00:27:53,110 --> 00:27:54,050
to pick something up.

413
00:27:54,400 --> 00:27:55,180
Let me get it and show you.

414
00:28:04,270 --> 00:28:04,770
What do you think?

415
00:28:05,110 --> 00:28:05,660
Isn't it beautiful?

416
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:07,860
It's beautiful.

417
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:10,220
This is the wedding gown

418
00:28:10,310 --> 00:28:11,700
passed down to the wives of Yunyi Sect's leaders.

419
00:28:12,070 --> 00:28:12,940
Of course it's exquisite.

420
00:28:13,550 --> 00:28:15,900
And now it's yours.

421
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:20,460
Youyou.

422
00:28:21,270 --> 00:28:22,220
Take good care of this gown.

423
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:26,770
I'll try it on for you right now.

424
00:28:42,510 --> 00:28:43,290
Oh, it's you.

425
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:45,140
Have you seen Shen Wangyan?

426
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:03,460
You're Yamao's friend, right?

427
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:05,420
When is she coming back?

428
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:07,700
If my calculations are right,

429
00:29:08,310 --> 00:29:10,220
she should be back today.

430
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:11,010
Good.

431
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:12,420
The Wish Tree has appeared.

432
00:29:12,550 --> 00:29:13,740
Tell Yamao and Qi Fengyin

433
00:29:13,740 --> 00:29:14,620
to hurry back.

434
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:15,730
I'm getting married tonight.

435
00:29:15,830 --> 00:29:16,250
I don't want them

436
00:29:16,270 --> 00:29:17,410
to miss my wedding.

437
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:21,980
Oh, right!

438
00:29:23,110 --> 00:29:23,700
Does it look good?

439
00:29:32,510 --> 00:29:33,290
You little fool.

440
00:30:15,350 --> 00:30:16,530
Good thing there's moonlight tonight.

441
00:30:36,310 --> 00:30:37,180
How long was I asleep?

442
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:38,660
Several hours.

443
00:30:40,070 --> 00:30:40,810
Are you all right?

444
00:30:46,350 --> 00:30:47,250
Let's go to the cottage.

445
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:37,380
Youyou.

446
00:31:46,720 --> 00:31:47,730
Time for my medicine?

447
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:49,860
Once you've taken it, it'll be time.

448
00:31:50,510 --> 00:31:51,980
Then we'll go to the Wish Tree together.

449
00:31:54,550 --> 00:31:56,090
Is it time already?

450
00:31:58,550 --> 00:32:00,330
Are Yamao and Qi Fengyin back yet?

451
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:01,620
Be good.

452
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:02,900
Everyone in the Demon Capital

453
00:32:02,900 --> 00:32:03,770
is waiting for you.

454
00:32:04,550 --> 00:32:04,940
Here.

455
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:39,770
Who lives in this room?

456
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:46,250
Qi Fengyin.

457
00:32:46,510 --> 00:32:46,940
Come here.

458
00:32:52,550 --> 00:32:53,980
The woman in this painting is dressed

459
00:32:55,030 --> 00:32:57,090
like a fellow disciple of Shen Wangyan's.

460
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:59,180
And she's playing the Floating Shadow Zither.

461
00:33:00,030 --> 00:33:01,290
Shen Wangyan once told Youyou

462
00:33:02,030 --> 00:33:02,940
that apart from him,

463
00:33:04,000 --> 00:33:05,980
only the sect leader's wife can play it.

464
00:33:14,640 --> 00:33:15,860
Congratulations!

465
00:33:15,860 --> 00:33:17,400
Congratulations!

466
00:33:24,030 --> 00:33:25,380
May you have a lifetime of happiness!

467
00:33:31,930 --> 00:33:32,720
Wonderful!

468
00:33:34,310 --> 00:33:35,660
Congratulations!

469
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:37,010
May your love last a lifetime!

470
00:33:37,360 --> 00:33:38,740
She's beautiful!

471
00:33:42,830 --> 00:33:44,010
Congratulations!

472
00:33:47,720 --> 00:33:49,140
Congratulations!

473
00:33:55,380 --> 00:33:56,520
Congratulations!

474
00:34:07,730 --> 00:34:09,300
- Congratulations! - Congratulations!

475
00:34:09,300 --> 00:34:10,030
Congratulations!

476
00:34:10,030 --> 00:34:11,340
May you have a happy marriage!

477
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:15,570
They're perfect for each other!

478
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:17,610
What a joyous occasion!

479
00:34:18,550 --> 00:34:19,900
May your love last forever!

480
00:34:20,550 --> 00:34:21,900
Wishing you a lifetime of happiness!

481
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:22,940
That's right.

482
00:34:23,670 --> 00:34:24,690
Congratulations to you both!

483
00:34:27,190 --> 00:34:28,420
You're so ugly!

484
00:34:31,960 --> 00:34:33,050
You vile demon!

485
00:34:33,540 --> 00:34:34,550
They look so happy!

486
00:34:35,230 --> 00:34:36,740
Why aren't you dead yet?

487
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:38,570
How wonderful!

488
00:34:38,590 --> 00:34:39,650
Congratulations!

489
00:34:46,920 --> 00:34:47,940
Why are you hiding your face?

490
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:48,980
How dare you, demon!

491
00:34:49,030 --> 00:34:49,860
What's your true form?

492
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:52,530
The Demon Capital is crawling with demons! We will conquer the Demon Capital

493
00:34:52,920 --> 00:34:53,900
and wipe out every demon!

494
00:34:54,670 --> 00:34:56,170
You're hideous!

495
00:34:57,000 --> 00:34:57,780
You monster!

496
00:34:58,700 --> 00:35:00,590
May you always be happy!

497
00:35:00,590 --> 00:35:02,210
Why won't you just die?

498
00:35:02,210 --> 00:35:03,220
Congratulations!

499
00:35:05,090 --> 00:35:06,880
She's beautiful!

500
00:35:17,030 --> 00:35:18,130
The stench of blood is overwhelming.

501
00:35:18,760 --> 00:35:20,010
It's coming from the Luoliang Demon Capital.

502
00:35:33,190 --> 00:35:33,820
Youyou.

503
00:35:35,590 --> 00:35:36,210
You're awake?

504
00:35:51,960 --> 00:35:52,860
Wangyan.

505
00:35:54,670 --> 00:35:56,050
I feel awful.

506
00:35:58,510 --> 00:35:59,900
Could it be

507
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:02,960
that the injuries Wuwang Sect inflicted

508
00:36:02,960 --> 00:36:03,610
still haven't healed?

509
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:06,100
But I've been

510
00:36:06,100 --> 00:36:07,650
taking my medicine like you told me.

511
00:36:08,510 --> 00:36:09,490
You must be hungry.

512
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:10,980
You haven't eaten

513
00:36:10,980 --> 00:36:12,010
a thing all day.

514
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:24,420
I don't want any.

515
00:36:25,400 --> 00:36:26,050
Be good.

516
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:28,260
How can you recover without your medicine?

517
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,130
How will you become the ruler of all demons

518
00:36:30,710 --> 00:36:31,980
and protect your people?

519
00:36:38,880 --> 00:36:39,380
Here.

520
00:37:09,150 --> 00:37:09,860
Slow down.

521
00:37:10,840 --> 00:37:11,690
There's plenty more.

522
00:37:12,710 --> 00:37:13,570
Plenty more.

523
00:37:36,710 --> 00:37:37,530
High Immortal Danshen.

524
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:43,130
Perhaps High Immortal Danshen

525
00:37:43,320 --> 00:37:44,130
instinctively

526
00:37:44,230 --> 00:37:45,300
put up a protective barrier.

527
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:47,210
High Immortal Danshen,

528
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:48,480
what I'm about to do

529
00:37:48,480 --> 00:37:49,700
is very dangerous.

530
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:51,570
I'll have to hide you somewhere safe.

531
00:38:08,760 --> 00:38:09,300
Youyou.

532
00:38:23,510 --> 00:38:24,690
Youyou, stop eating!

533
00:38:25,230 --> 00:38:26,070
Stop!

534
00:38:26,280 --> 00:38:26,860
Get away!

535
00:38:27,710 --> 00:38:28,420
I'm getting you out of here!

536
00:38:28,920 --> 00:38:29,650
We'll find Yamao!

537
00:38:29,670 --> 00:38:30,570
We'll find Qi Fengyin!

538
00:38:30,840 --> 00:38:31,260
Come on!

539
00:38:31,840 --> 00:38:33,650
I'm not leaving! I'm not leaving!

540
00:38:33,880 --> 00:38:34,570
Let go of me!

541
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:36,460
If you won't leave, I'll destroy it!

542
00:38:46,000 --> 00:38:46,610
Let her go!

543
00:38:46,630 --> 00:38:47,690
I won't let you destroy her!

544
00:38:58,150 --> 00:38:58,690
Youyou.

545
00:39:00,030 --> 00:39:00,740
Wangyan...

546
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:03,490
What's going on?

547
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:07,860
I feel like there's a fire burning inside me.

548
00:39:10,840 --> 00:39:13,090
That's because your demonic core

549
00:39:13,150 --> 00:39:14,570
is turning into the Demon Soul Talisman.

550
00:39:18,630 --> 00:39:19,940
Want to know what's happening?

551
00:39:21,220 --> 00:39:22,650
I'll show you right now.

552
00:40:19,230 --> 00:40:20,080
Wangyan...

553
00:40:22,150 --> 00:40:23,010
What's going on?

554
00:40:26,400 --> 00:40:27,460
How could this happen?

555
00:40:28,480 --> 00:40:29,820
Why are you so upset?

556
00:40:31,760 --> 00:40:32,570
Weren't you the one

557
00:40:32,590 --> 00:40:33,650
who killed all these people?

558
00:40:39,230 --> 00:40:39,940
I...

559
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:43,010
Every demon in this city

560
00:40:44,190 --> 00:40:45,740
was slaughtered.

561
00:40:45,800 --> 00:40:46,860
All by your hand.

562
00:40:57,070 --> 00:40:57,900
Their demonic cores

563
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:58,860
were ripped out, too.

564
00:40:59,590 --> 00:41:01,380
And now they're inside your stomach.

565
00:41:02,030 --> 00:41:03,050
You must be hungry.

566
00:41:03,440 --> 00:41:04,050
Be good.

567
00:41:09,030 --> 00:41:10,610
Weren't you just stuffing your face,

568
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:12,380
unable to stop eating?

569
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,170
You must be wondering

570
00:41:43,070 --> 00:41:43,610
why Wuwang Sect

571
00:41:43,630 --> 00:41:45,260
attacked the Demon Capital.

572
00:41:46,070 --> 00:41:47,420
Because they weren't wrong.

573
00:41:48,230 --> 00:41:49,690
Those villages that were slaughtered?

574
00:41:50,630 --> 00:41:51,820
You really were responsible.

575
00:41:53,280 --> 00:41:54,340
On the night of the Demon Lantern Festival,

576
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:56,120
I put a poisonous flower

577
00:41:56,120 --> 00:41:57,260
in your pastries.

